From 35e8526701a561b7fbdfa6c423b582b382eab28b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Zhang <willzhang058@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:28:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add explicit DbReader refresh through the manifest poller

Squash of the four commits of slatedb/slatedb#2080 (7d58b7ec, 6c758a7f,
5c7fdbda, 9a5ff23d): DbReader::refresh() asks the manifest poller for
fresh persisted state without waiting for the poll, with the test race
fixed, checkpoint cleanup inlined, and the reader's checkpoint kept until
the refreshed state is installed.
